Description: Grok Build CLI for jailbroken iOS
 SpaceXAI's terminal coding agent (`grok`), cross-compiled for iOS and
 packaged for both roothide and rootless bootstraps from one arm64 build.
 The architecture field says which layout this package is, not which CPU
 it runs on. Upstream is @UPSTREAM@.
 .
 Run `grok` in a terminal on device. Sign in with an xAI API key or the
 browser flow (`uiopen` must be on PATH).
